        },
        {
          "text": "Maqaani kiyya Yuda, hojattu Yeso Kristotiifi oboleesa Yakobo; gara worra Waaqi yaame, ka jaalala Abba Waaqa keesa taufi ka qorqorti Yeso Kristo jala jiruti tatabe tana t'aafa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.1",
