        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaalaani tiyya, anini guddo herege aka waan baafama nuuni ch'ufti woliini qamnu isani t'aafu; duuba tatabe tana ya isanii t'aafe aka isani jabaattani, d'ugefacha Waaqi gumi isaa ch'ufa maro tokotu kenne jabeesitani badi d'owartani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti akanatiifi nami gari ka Waaqa imbeenne, ato nu imbeekatiini ya jiddu teenna seene, aka d'araa ufi guutatu, dubbi eeba Waaqa gaargalche Yeso Kristo Aabbo keenna tokochale dide. Duri duri t'aafiini qulqullooni qorsuma worri argatu tana fadde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
