              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.1+NUM.16.2+NUM.16.3+NUM.16.4+NUM.16.5+NUM.16.6+NUM.16.7+NUM.16.8+NUM.16.9+NUM.16.10+NUM.16.11+NUM.16.12+NUM.16.13+NUM.16.14+NUM.16.15+NUM.16.16+NUM.16.17+NUM.16.18+NUM.16.19+NUM.16.20+NUM.16.21+NUM.16.22+NUM.16.23+NUM.16.24+NUM.16.25+NUM.16.26+NUM.16.27+NUM.16.28+NUM.16.29+NUM.16.30+NUM.16.31+NUM.16.32+NUM.16.33+NUM.16.34+NUM.16.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.1-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gaargala worraati! Ya kara Kainini deeme fud'atani; ya maro horitiifi akuma Balaamu wollaala gula badani; ya aka Korani lole lolani ufi balleesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle worri farso ch'eera foko male d'uge, jila teesani t'ureesa, worri ufi ch'alla qorqorata. Worri aka dumansa bokaya inqamne, ka bubbeeni d'oofte jira. Aka mukha ch'aamsaale mid'aani imbaamne jira mukha buqisani goge fakaata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka d'awa baariini jira, hujiini worraa hamtuuni aka homachaa mullati. Aka urji ch'eetu jira, Waaqi ya fulla dukana sipeti haga jira jireenna teesuma worraa mid'aase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
