          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gara isaa ka dandae jigu isani d'owe, wollaala male gammadaani guddinna isaati isani geesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqa tokocha, Qarqaarsa keenna, Aabbo keenna Yeso Kristo keesa, guddinnaafi ulfinnafi humnafi jabeenni ka duriitifi ka ammalleeni ha tahu, ammafi hegerile! Amini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
